WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:09.560
After all the pain we gave them, four of them are still hanging in.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.620
Then we'll just have to use a different way.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.450
A different way?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.680
Make them have a taste...

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.450
...of true despair.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.770
Death Sword!

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.820
Machine Soldier Galleus!

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.760
He blocks Tsurugi's Death Sword!

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.040
Now it's my turn.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.530
Conjurer Purim!

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.530
He has an Avatar too?!

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.780
Magician's Box!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.970
Burning Catch!

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.490
Goal!

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:28.100
Mannouzaka gets the next point!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:32.270
Minutes into the start of the second half, and Raimon has been pushed down at a score of 2-1!

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.190
Th-This can't be...

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:43.250
They have three Seeds?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.390
Well, that settles it.

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:52.290
There's no way we'd win against three Seeds anyway.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.050
Just give it up already.

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:11.630
I won't give up!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.710
The game resumes with Raimon's ball!

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:58.200
The score is 2-1 with Mannouzaka in the lead!

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.960
Kurama and the others are still frozen at the touchlines!

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:04.430
Can Raimon keep fighting like this?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.830
I can't expect anything out of Tsurugi.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:10.990
Tenma, Shinsuke, stay close.

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.650
We'll attack them all at once!

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:13.190
Okay!

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:16.300
Captain!

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:17.550
Shinsuke!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.150
Raimon comes up with passes!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.400
Tsurugi charges ahead of them!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.400
Is he trying to attack by himself again?

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.080
<i>So what?</i>

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:35.890
<i>Someone like him deserves never to play soccer again!</i>

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.920
I'll destroy this corrupted soccer with my own hands!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.760
Mitsuyoshi!

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:47.080
The two Seeds are joining together for the defense?!

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:51.890
You think you can take us down?

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:53.230
Tsurugi!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.400
Tsurugi heads up boldly, but he's no match for Mannouzaka's defense!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.370
Pass it over here!

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:15.870
Is he really trying to beat Mannouzaka?

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.600
He's obviously just bluffing.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.670
Tsurugi is surrounded!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:29.970
The ball has finally been stolen from Tsurugi!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:30.930
Isozaki!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.350
Do you get it now?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.650
The fact is, there's no possible way for you guys to beat us.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.060
Here's a present from us!

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:41.380
Tsurugi!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:42.050
Tsurugi!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.070
Oh, did Tsurugi slip up on the trapping?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.030
He's been sent flying!

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.260
What?

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.850
Take this, you double-crosser!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.660
They're aiming right at Tsurugi!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.230
A beat-down between fellow Fifth Sector members?

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:05.490
Now <i>this</i>  is something to watch.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.600
Get lost already!

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:12.880
You'll regret betraying Fifth Sector!

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.150
Tsurugi!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.530
You think a kick like that would take me down?!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.860
So you still don't get it.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.180
Ushio! Oosawada!

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.870
Sakazaki! Busujima!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.250
Tsurugi is surrounded again!

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.560
Over here, Tsurugi!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:47.300
Even if you're a Seed, you can't win against eleven people all by yourself!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.750
We feel the same way as you!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.340
If you really want to win, work with us!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:53.600
Tsurugi!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.280
Tsurugi!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.510
Tsurugi...

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.730
It's mine!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.130
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.880
I don't consider you to be a teammate.

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:16.660
Sure.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.020
The match is only getting started!

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:19.660
Yes.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.280
Tenma!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.130
Elephant Press!

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:39.680
Tenma!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:44.650
Just because you're working together doesn't mean you're a match for us.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.690
Fall into despair, Raimon.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:48.570
Ushio!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.440
Busujima!

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.070
Sakazaki!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.600
Mannouzaka comes up for the attack!

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.170
Are they going for another point to widen the gap?

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.650
The score is 2-1.

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:04.290
When you consider that goalkeeper can use an Avatar,

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.130
we can't afford to lose another point!

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.840
Protect the goal no matter what!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:10.920
Okay!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.260
Bring it!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:16.060
You think you can protect the goal with just five people?

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.300
Give them no mercy!

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:19.900
Score 10 or 20 if you have to!

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:23.960
Keep scoring until they lose all the will to stand up to us!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.270
I won't let you!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.670
Boomerang Feint!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.660
He passed Nishizono!

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.060
Shinsuke!

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.010
He passed Matsukaze too!

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.000
Mannouzaka brings the ball to their forward!

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.070
I won't let you shoot!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.550
You're not getting past me!

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:54.920
Captain!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.980
Mitsuyoshi, over here!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.110
The intense battle continues!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.100
And here comes Shirato!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:13.650
Bound Flame!

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.160
Sangoku-san!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.930
I won't let it in the goal!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:29.760
Burning Catch!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.900
Sangoku hits it back!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.300
But Mannouzaka's attack hasn't ended!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.080
This is amazing! It's a storm of attacks!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.350
Mannouzaka just keeps attacking furiously!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.530
Sangoku-san!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.780
I-I can't keep watching this...

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:09.710
Sangoku-san!

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:12.520
Don't!

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:16.590
If you play with your leg like that, you really won't ever be able to play soccer again!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.000
I know!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.550
But at this rate...

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.440
Hey, you guys!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.450
Don't you feel <i>anything</i>  watching them play?

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:36.230
I know you're worried about Fifth Sector and all,

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:40.970
but aren't these guys your soccer buddies?!

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:45.820
You joined the club together, ate together,

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:48.040
and you came this far with them around!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:52.380
Those guys are desperately doing everything they can to protect Raimon's soccer!

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.470
Yet you guys don't feel <i>anything</i> ?!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.470
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.940
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:26.530
Over here, Busujima!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:30.980
The ball is passed over to Mitsuyoshi!

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:33.670
Mitsuyoshi, shoot with your Avatar!

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:36.170
Sangoku-san!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.350
If they score here, it'll be 3-1.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:45.180
That practically ends the match!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.430
I'll stop it no matter what!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.530
Even if I fall apart doing so!

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:54.480
Conjurer Purim!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.820
Is the Avatar shoot coming?!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:58.430
No!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:01.240
Sangoku-san won't be able to stop that Avatar shoot!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.960
Dash Train!

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:18.910
What?!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.020
K-Kurumada steals the ball!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.140
That was Kurumada-senpai's hissatsu technique...

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.720
Whoa...

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.020
Senpai!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:30.970
Kurumada-san!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:32.510
Kurumada!

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:37.310
I'm not letting you guys do whatever you like anymore.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:40.210
I don't care who we're up against!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.180
We'll protect our soccer!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.830
Hamano, we're going too!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.320
After what he just said, we can't sit back now.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.080
You're going?!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:54.750
Then me too.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:58.080
Amagi-san! Hayami! Hamano!

00:12:58.390 --> 00:12:59.610
Senpai!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:01.870
Let's go, guys!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.880
This is where the <i>real</i>  game starts!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.050
Yeah!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.090
We'll show you how Raimon plays soccer!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.220
Now this feels like a team!

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:13.830
They did it, Endou-san!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.300
Sangoku-kun and the others' feelings reached everyone.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:18.210
Yeah!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.290
What do you think you can do with just a few more people?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.870
We'll show you that we're on a different level altogether.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:34.000
Matsukaze!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.330
Is this the start of Raimon's counterattack?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.080
Matsukaze dribbles on the offense!

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:41.090
You're not getting through!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.850
Soyokaze Step!

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.780
All right! Nice, Tenma!

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:51.050
Hamano-senpai!

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:52.880
Hamano takes the pass up!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.470
Kuranoin!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.950
Surfing Pierrot!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:06.830
There it is!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:10.170
That was Hamano's hissatsu technique, Surfing Pierrot!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:10.530
What?

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:12.820
Awesome!

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.120
Senpai had that kind of hissatsu technique!

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.620
Don't get so cocky!

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:21.670
Mannouzaka steals the ball back!

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.560
This is turning out to be quite a terrific match!

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.390
Neither team is backing down in the even fight!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.630
Only a short time left in the second half!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.350
Will it end at 2-1?!

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:33.970
Mitsuyoshi!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.230
Mannouzaka connects the ball to a forward!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.140
Oh no!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.150
If he gets it, he'll make an Avatar shoot!

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:45.090
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:47.820
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:57.000
Amagi blocks him with a hissatsu technique!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:58.870
Nice, Amagi-san!

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.060
Isozaki goes for the ball!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.160
But Kurama isn't moving an inch!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.280
Over here!

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:12.780
Kurama!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.680
Head up, Mitsuyoshi!

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:17.370
Kurama!

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.020
Kurama!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:18.390
Kurama!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.160
Tsurugi takes the ball!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.050
And he's heading up!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:35.990
Shinoyama!

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.050
Leave it to me!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.250
I won't let him score!

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:45.000
His Avatar!

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.030
Machine Soldier Galleus!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.810
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.960
Tsurugi releases his Avatar as well!

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.460
It's Avatar versus Avatar!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.780
Lost Angel!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.790
Guardian Shield!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.330
It hit!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.630
What an amazing clash!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:39.250
Tsurugi...

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:56.190
Lancelot breaks past Galleus's shield!

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.410
Go, Lancelot!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.760
Goal!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.320
Raimon scores its second point!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:15.170
They're tied!

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:16.680
All right, tied!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:18.930
Tsurugi!

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:24.350
He broke past my Avatar...

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.410
All right, we'll go right ahead and turn the score around!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:27.900
Yeah!

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:33.030
Captain!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.430
Shindou takes the pass!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.530
He's completely free!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:39.500
Shinoyama!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.980
Machine Soldier Galleus!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:45.620
It's no good!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.640
Fortissimo!

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:52.680
I can't stop it without my Avatar!

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:54.650
Yes!

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:56.120
Goal!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.740
Raimon makes a third goal!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.510
They've finally turned the tables!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:02.840
There's the end match whistle!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.930
Raimon makes a comeback victory!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:10.560
At 3-2, Raimon has defeated Mannouzaka and will proceed to the district preliminary semi-finals!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:10.560
All right!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.210
We did it, we did it!

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:13.580
We did it!

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.110
Tenma!

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:15.570
Shindou!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:15.920
Shindou-kun!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.110
We did it, Shindou.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:20.770
Yes!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:23.050
We did it, we did it!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.280
Tenma!

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.780
We finally did it.

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:30.120
Why...

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:35.380
Why did a team with three Seeds lose to guys like Raimon...

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:45.380
Hey.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:47.600
We did it!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:49.600
We did it!

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:50.310
Tenma, Tenma!

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:56.570
Good work, guys!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:02.110
This victory is the first obtained with everyone's hard effort.

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:05.200
If we combine our strength, there's nothing we can't do!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.120
Let's do our best to aim for the Holy Road championship!

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:10.620
Yes, sir!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:15.590
Tsurugi!

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:19.380
Thanks, Tsurugi.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.270
Thanks!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:31.950
W-What?!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.480
They won with 3-2?!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.150
We're doomed.

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.970
This time, we're really doomed.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.620
Chairman!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.300
Cheers!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:50.010
Congrats on making it to the semi-finals.

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:52.110
This is a celebration gift from me.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:54.920
A strawberry royal triple-layer cake!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:58.420
Looks good!

00:19:58.420 --> 00:19:59.580
I'm taking this one!

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:03.450
I wanted that strawberry!

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:04.630
Then I'll take this one!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:05.680
That one too!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:06.630
Oh, c'mon!

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:08.180
Geez, you two!

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:12.860
It was really awesome!

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:16.190
He charged into them like a train, yelling "Dash Train!"

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:20.270
I thought Kurumada-senpai was just big talk,

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.700
but I was so surprised to see him pull off a hissatsu technique like that!

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.370
Don't forget Amagi-senpai's hissatsu!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.460
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.710
He blocked that Seed's attack with that!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.900
Right, Shinsuke?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.190
Hissatsu technique...

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:36.750
What's wrong?

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:39.380
N-Nothing!

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.270
And Hamano-senpai's hissatsu!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:44.750
Surfing Pierrot! That was cool too!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:45.870
And the Avatar!

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:46.710
Yeah, yeah!

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.810
Tsurugi's Lancelot was awesome too!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.700
<i>So what?</i>

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:06.190
<i>Someone like him deserves never to play soccer again!</i>

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:11.900
I don't regret beating them and their soccer.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:12.580
But...

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:18.500
Kuroki-san.

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:21.500
Come with me.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:56.520
"I want to be more useful to the team."

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:59.700
Shinsuke's passionate feelings motivate the upperclassmen!

00:22:59.700 --> 00:23:03.520
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Shinsuke's Hissatsu Technique!

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.470
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:17.870
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:26.080
If we combine our strength, there's nothing we can't do!

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:26.760
That's all!
